<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 72pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 72pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt">(ii) a completed and executed
copy of the Closing Statement, attached hereto as&nbsp;<U>Annex A</U>;</P>

